  "problem_statement": "When coap_build_reply_header() builds a reply from a CoAP request that contains an RFC 8974 extended token, the returned length can be shorter than the header actually assembled. The function must return the true length of the constructed reply header. In the tests, it is called for parsed requests with overlong tokens and no payload, with payload length 0 and NULL payload/maximum fields, and the returned length must allow the reply to parse back with the expected total header length, code, ID, and token.",
